{
  "about": "T.H.E.L.M.A. CRM Complete connections file. Fill in what you have, delete the rest, then upload it under Connections (or in the first-sign-in walk-through). Keys are stored encrypted and never shown again. Do NOT put website passwords here.",
  "connections": [
    {
      "name": "Google sign-in",
